{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12754","headline":"奉送王相公赴幽州 · 张继","name":"奉送王相公赴幽州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄阁开帏幄，丹墀拜冕旒。\n位高汤左相，权总汉诸侯。\n不改周南化，仍分赵北忧。\n双旌过易水，千骑入幽州。\n塞草连天幕，边风动地愁。\n无因随远道，结束佩吴钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}